    "chunk_text": "a \u00e6t his \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se \u00e6\u00feela lareow to \u00fe\u00e6m engle \u00fee hine l\u00e6dde, Hw\u00e6t is \u00fees ealda man? Se engel him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hit is an biscop se dyde mare yfel \u00feonne god; he onfeng for worlde mycelne \u00deonne s\u00e6gde Sanctus Paulus \u00fe\u00e6t se biscop n\u00e6re miltsiende wydewum, ne steopcildum, ne nanum & her s\u00e6g\u00fe on \u00feyssum bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m biscopum \u00fee her on worlde syndon, swy\u00fee gelice gegange Se biscop sceal, \u00fee wile onfon Godes mildheortnesse & his synna forgifnesse, \u00ferafian \u00fea & \u00fea l\u00e6wedan men \u00fee hie aldormen ofer beon sceolan, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6m ne ge\u00feafian \u00fe\u00e6t hie heora lif on For\u00feon se goda lareow s\u00e6gde, \u00feonne se m\u00e6ssepreost o\u00fe\u00fee se biscop w\u00e6re gel\u00e6ded on ece forwyrd; Hwane mana\u00fe God maran gafoles \u00feonne \u00feone biscop? For\u00feon \u00fee se biscop bi\u00fe Godes gingra, & he bi\u00fe efenhalig his apostolum, & efnhlete his witgum, gif Swa Sanctus Paulus s\u00e6gde, \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylfa bebude Moyse \u00fe\u00e6t he o\u00ferum lareowum s\u00e6gde, gif hi \u00fe\u00e6t Swa se \u00e6\u00feela lareow s\u00e6gde, \u00fe\u00e6t se cyning & se biscop sceoldan beon Cristenra folca hyrdas, & hi & gif mon \u00feonne ne mihte hi to rihte gecyrron, \u00fe\u00e6t hi heora wohd\u00e6da geswican woldan, \u00feonne sceal Se biscop & se m\u00e6ssepreost gif hi mid rihte willa\ufffd",
